Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: BlockBody

    2 Expressions: Expressions COMMA Expression
    3            | Expression

    4 NonAttributedExpression: Block
    5                        | Call
    6                        | Function
    7                        | Type
    8                        | MatchExpression
    9                        | RuntimeExpression
   10                        | WrappedExpressions
   11                        | Literal

   12 WrappedExpressions: LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   13 Expression: Block
   14           | Call
   15           | Function
   16           | Type
   17           | MatchExpression
   18           | RuntimeExpression
   19           | WrappedExpressions
   20           | AttributedExpression
   21           | Literal

   22 Block: LBRACE BlockBody RBRACE

   23 BlockBody: Statements Expressions
   24          | Expressions

   25 MatchExpression: MATCH LPAREN Expression RPAREN LBRACE MatchCases RBRACE

   26 MatchCases: MatchCases MatchCase
   27           | MatchCase

   28 MatchCase: CASE Expression COLON Expressions SEMI

   29 Function: FUNCTION LPAREN FunctionParameters RPAREN FunctionAttributes FunctionBody PERCENT

   30 FunctionParameters: FunctionParameters COMMA FunctionParameter
   31                   | FunctionParameter

   32 FunctionParameter: AccessAttribute IDENTIFIER TypeAttribute

   33 FunctionAttributes: FunctionAttributes FunctionAttribute
   34                   | FunctionAttribute

   35 FunctionAttribute: FunctionExternalAttribute
   36                  | FunctionInternalAttribute

   37 FunctionExternalAttribute: EXTERNAL LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   38 FunctionInternalAttribute: INTERNAL LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   39 FunctionBody: COLON Expressions
   40             | ε

   41 Call: NonAttributedExpression LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   42 RuntimeExpression: RUNTIME LPAREN Expression RPAREN

   43 Literal: STRING
   44        | INTEGER
   45        | FLOAT
   46        | CHAR
   47        | Identifier
   48        | MACRO
   49        | NIL

   50 Identifier: Identifier DOT IDENTIFIER
   51           | IDENTIFIER

   52 Type: TYPE LPAREN Expression RPAREN LBRACE TypeEntries RBRACE

   53 Statements: Statements Statement
   54           | Statement

   55 Statement: CallStatement
   56          | AssignmentStatement
   57          | ContinueStatement
   58          | BreakStatement
   59          | LabelStatement

   60 CallStatement: Call SEMI

   61 AssignmentStatement: AssignmentTarget EQ Expressions SEMI

   62 AssignmentTarget: AccessAttribute IDENTIFIER TypeAttribute
   63                 | Identifier
   64                 | UNDERSCORE

   65 ContinueStatement: CONTINUE IDENTIFIER Expressions SEMI

   66 BreakStatement: BREAK IDENTIFIER Expressions SEMI

   67 LabelStatement: IDENTIFIER COLON MatchExpression SEMI
   68               | IDENTIFIER COLON SEMI

   69 TypeAttributeOptional: TypeAttribute
   70                      | ε

   71 TypeAttribute: COLON Expression

   72 TypeEntries: TypeEntries TypeEntry
   73            | TypeEntry

   74 TypeEntry: IDENTIFIER TypeAttributeOptional SEMI

   75 AccessAttribute: IN
   76                | OUT
   77                | INOUT

   78 PointerAttribute: PTR
   79                 | REF

   80 AttributedExpression: AccessAttribute Expression
   81                     | PointerAttribute AttributedExpression


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    COMMA (258) 2 30
    LBRACE (259) 22 25 52
    RBRACE (260) 22 25 52
    LPAREN (261) 12 25 29 37 38 41 42 52
    RPAREN (262) 12 25 29 37 38 41 42 52
    SEMI (263) 28 60 61 65 66 67 68 74
    COLON (264) 28 39 67 68 71
    EQ (265) 61
    UNDERSCORE (266) 64
    PERCENT (267) 29
    DOT (268) 50
    MATCH (269) 25
    CASE (270) 28
    FUNCTION (271) 29
    TYPE (272) 52
    EXTERNAL (273) 37
    INTERNAL (274) 38
    IN (275) 75
    OUT (276) 76
    INOUT (277) 77
    REF (278) 79
    PTR (279) 78
    CONTINUE (280) 65
    BREAK (281) 66
    RUNTIME (282) 42
    IDENTIFIER (283) 32 50 51 62 65 66 67 68 74
    STRING (284) 43
    INTEGER (285) 44
    FLOAT (286) 45
    CHAR (287) 46
    MACRO (288) 48
    NIL (289) 49


